OL,3,GNEWSA'We only had a few seconds to save
OL,4,Apassengers'                            
OL,6,FSpeaking publicly for the first time   
OL,7,Fsince Williams was convicted, Johnson  
OL,8,Ftold BBC Breakfast: "We only had a few 
OL,9,Fseconds to instigate the move or it'd  
OL,10,Fbe too late."                          
